            <note corresp="#d235-f3" n="3" xml:id="d235-f3-content">
                <p>The Task Force Report is printed as <ref target="#d233">Document 233</ref>.
                    Regarding the Staley Report, see <ref target="frus1961-63v01#d93"><hi
